& \symb{f}(\symb{cons}(x_3,\symb{cons}(z_3,\var{zs}_3)), y_3) & \to & x_3 + \symb{f}(\var{zs}_3, y_3 - \symb{2}) & \Constraint{\, x_3 > \symb{0} \land y_3 > \symb{1} \,} \\
\end{array}
\right\}
\]
