$\{ \symb{f}(\symb{cons}(x_1,\var{xs}_1),y_1) \}$
and
$\{ \symb{f}(\symb{nil},y_1), \symb{f}(\symb{cons}(x_1,\symb{cons}(z_1,\var{zs}_1)),y_1) \}$, respectively.
