The LCTRS $\cRflist$ is not quasi-reducible because none of the following constrained patterns is defined: % by $\cRflist$:
\[
\begin{array}{@{}c@{~}r@{~}l@{}}
(\mathrm{a}) & \symb{f}(\symb{nil},y_{\mathrm{a}}) & \Constraint{\, \neg (y_{\mathrm{a}} \leq \symb{0}) \,} \\
(\mathrm{b}) & \symb{f}(\symb{cons}(x_{\mathrm{b}},\symb{nil}),y_{\mathrm{b}}) & \Constraint{\, \neg(x_{\mathrm{b}} \leq \symb{0} \land y_{\mathrm{b}} > \symb{0}) \,} \\
