Corollary~\ref{cor:correctness-of-CopatternSetX} immediately implies decidability of quasi-reducibility for left-linear LCTRSs with decidable built-in theories.
\begin{restatable}{theorem}{ThmDecidabilityOfQuasiReducibilityOfLLLCTRSs}
\label{thm:decidability-of-quasi-reducibility-of-LL-LCTRSs}
