Consider the sequences evolved by \emph{Algorithm \ref{alg:iHPEP-Tseng-FB}}, let $d_{0,\gamma}$ denote the distance of $p^0$ to extended-solution set $\Sa_e \neq \emptyset$, let $\overline L, \underline L > 0$ be as in \eqref{eq:def.Lb} and let $\Omega_{(\alpha, \beta)} > 0$ be as in \eqref{eq:def.omega}. Suppose assumptions \emph{B1--B4} and
