In a nut shell, we find the  equation-of-state formalism provides adequate parameter space where the model  can imitate  recent data from various observational probes in the likes of Planck-2018, DESI-Y1, ACT-DR6 along with their combinations. However the non-detection of primordial tensor perturbations by LikeBIRD and/or CMB-S4 will significantly reduce the range for $\beta$ while enhancing the observational window for $\alpha$ to some extent. 




