\textbf{Limitations.}  While the proposed novel route for the convergence proof of Adam simplifies the theoretical analysis, extending the proof to weaker assumptions (Assumptions C.3) compared to prior work needs the introduction of additional constraints (Conditions 1–3), although these conditions are commonly satisfied in practical settings that are demonstrated in Section 3.

