where the lowest bound achieved if and only if $\frac{4 C_1(F(\bm{x}_{0}) - F^*)}{\gamma T \sqrt{d}} = {4C_1\sqrt{1-\beta_1}R}\hat{\sigma}$  and $ {4C_1\sqrt{1-\beta_1}R}\hat{\sigma} = \frac{8C_1\gamma R^2 \sqrt{d} \hat{L} }{1-\beta_1}$, and we further obtain
