We present the following strong approximation lemma for a stationary $\alpha$-mixing sequence  in \cite{PP80}.
\begin{lemma}\label{lem:emp-alpha}
Let $\{U^{(k)}\}_{k\ge 1}$ be a stationary $\alpha$-mixing sequence of uniform distributed random variables
